# Selected Git history (newest first; oldest and latest two content changes):
# 2026-10-03 [a7058b7] Close the gate's mask, repair the mirror, and correct the round's text
# 2026-10-03 [a362eb3] Scope the coverage run to the plugin so test stand-ins stay out of the data

# The coverage run measures the plugin only. Tests import stand-ins
# from temporary directories (the pinned onnxruntime install), and a
# measured file whose source is gone before the report makes
# `coverage json` abort — the gate must judge mpf/, never a test's
# scratch tree.
[run]
source = mpf
